            <profile id="f3cf-229e-e173-3456" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. May have thrusting spear +2 pts, or javelins +2 pts. May ride a horse (free, increases Movement to 8, +1 save). May have light armour +3 pts, heavy armour +4 pts. May have peltae (buckler) +2 pts, or shield +3 pts. Army General. Stealth. The Warlord is subject to Warband Psychology. If a Warlord is the Army General the army represents a Highland Thracian army. (Alexander the Great p.83)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="a2a8-3249-f11b-7b22" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
