              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, javelins and buckler. May upgrade to shields +1 pt. Every second unit may replace javelins and bucklers with bow +1 pt (not enforced). Lowland tribesmen may add thrusting spears +1 pt. Warband Psychology. Light Infantry. Stealth. Thracian warriors must always pursue a fleeing enemy, they cannot hold themselves back. (Alexander the Great p.83)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="826b-15a5-8274-c588" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
