              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, light armour and thrusting spears. May have shields +2 pts. May upgrade to heavy armour +1 pt. Warband Psychology. Stealth. Every second cavalry unit may be Nobles (not enforced). Noble cavalry may fight in Wedge. (Alexander the Great p.83)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
