            <profile id="3621-d0b2-1a45-7108" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="0641-2ee1-c462-c414" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, bows, shields, and javelins. May have throwing spears +3 pts, and light armour +3 pts. Warband Psychology. Stealth. Light Cavalry. Getae cavalry may use Feigned Flight and Parthian Shot. One Getae Cavalry unit may be taken for each Noble or Light Cavalry unit in the army. Not available to a Highland army. (Alexander the Great p.83)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="e772-ab02-af2b-2f06" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
